melee-unlocked's jukebox (port/runtime/hle/jukebox.cpp, GPL-2.0-or-later) on the Switch (Melee-NX-NetPlay 0.4.7): the music packs
folder is the app's own (jukebox_switch.h, src/jukebox_shim/), the README it writes names the console's settings panel and
decoders, Tracks.txt is always written, nothing is opened in a file browser, and a player's file is capped at five minutes
on the console. Player files decode through linux_media::decode_audio (src/media_decode.cpp: minimp3, stb_vorbis, dr_wav,
dr_flac). Against a build-time copy with LF line ends and no byte-order mark (frontend/build.sh).
